    "bbox": [
      124.29,
      327.13,
      465.45,
      338.2
    ],
    "text": "NOTICE UNDER THE EXCHANGE CONTROL ACT (CHAPTER 423 OF THE CLE)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.89,
      351.13,
      539.85,
      374.2
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under subsections (1) and (2) of Section 17 of the Exchange Control Act, I, RaviKarunanayake, Minister of Finance, do by this Order -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.89,
      387.13,
      539.93,
      434.2
    ],
    "text": "(1) grant permission to persons resident in Sri Lanka who hold Non Resident Foreign Currency Accounts (NRFC),Resident Foreign Currency Accounts (RFC), Resident Non-Nationals\u2019 Foreign Currency Accounts (RNNFC) and ForeignExchange Earners\u2019 Accounts (FEEA) to acquire, hold and transfer securities issued outside Sri Lanka by utilizing balanceslying in the above accounts,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.89,
      447.13,
      539.89,
      494.2
    ],
    "text": "(2) grant permission to persons resident in Sri Lanka holding the accounts referred to in paragraph (1) above toacquire, hold and transfer shares issued by way of capitalization of reserves or current year profits as a benefit on the shares,or by way of a sub division or split of the shares, which have been acquired initially in terms of the provisions grantedhereby, and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.89,
      507.13,
      539.87,
      530.2
    ],
    "text": "(3) further state that the permissions given hereunder shall be in addition to the provisions of the Order publishedin the Gazette (Extraordinary) Notification No. 1686/50 of 01.01.2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      442.89,
      543.13,
      526.87,
      566.2
    ],
